福原愛AiFukuhara）</figcaption></figure><p>Netflix賺翻卻大裁員！年賺3498億仍砍1000人「史上最大裁員潮」</p><p>金智媛主演《Doctor X》收視飆！醫學顧問稱「醫療場面有錯是專家爭輸了」　網吐槽：輸很慘</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:34.555000+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1607,"images":31,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T06:15:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T07:56:21.698953+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:52.887566+00:00","content_hash":"4aee5091dab3e50cab3739bb5c76e71fe537a3f8e84a0fec4499506c4e797dc3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}